prompt:
Use case: identity-preserve. DARKLIGHT REQUIEM, PUNHOS DA RUÍNA (Fists of Ruin). Draw EXACTLY TWELVE separate COMPLETE characters, 3 rows of 4, generous transparent gutters, whole head/body/gauntlets/greaves/coat/effects contained per region. True RGBA transparency, no background haze, floor, cast shadow, drawn checkerboard, labels/grid/text.
VISUAL REFERENCES: reference1 approved Requiem normal combat sheet gives equipment and martial poses. Reference2 approved Rock combat sheet gives Rock identity. Reference3 approved 2skins x4forms comparison is authority for form hair/costume/aura. Reference4 is SAME dark RED iris design for ALL variants (#C40814/#5A0000), clean warm peach skin (#F6AE82 base), no red stripe, makeup or stain under eyes. Reference5 approved whole-character eight-view sheet supplies game camera and direction meanings.
TARGET IDENTITY: Rock. SLEEVELESS studded black leather VEST over skull graphic black shirt, muscular BARE upper arms, black cargo trousers. Gauntlets cover FOREARMS only. NO long coat, cape or sleeves.
TARGET FORM: Normal. Brown wavy hair, black clothes, silver hardware. No transformed crystal trim. DIM DARK CARMINE ember aura (#8A1028), less saturated and less intense than bright scarlet Ruptura.
TARGET MAIN DIRECTION: SE. SOUTHEAST/front-RIGHT three-quarter. Nose/chest/toes toward IMAGE LOWER RIGHT; front chest visible. Same camera as approved combat sheet.
Preserve youthful compact large-headed proportions, exact approved face and hair, clothes, belt/decorative silver HIP chain on character's anatomical left. No held weapons: TWO blackened steel forearm/fist gauntlets, silver/bronze curved fang ridges, crescent knuckle plates; TWO matching knee-to-toe armored greaves. Armor structure same in all forms. Energy clings to fists/forearms/shins/feet; follows active form, stronger at contact but readable armor and face. No animal-head armor. Full figures newly drawn, never collaged body parts, flat-rotated or mechanically mirrored asymmetries. Same front/slightly elevated RPG camera as game; NOT realistic adult, side-scrolling fighter, isometric or overhead-flat.
Crisp deliberate square pixel clusters and dark outlines like approved source, no blur, smoothing, airbrushing or photorealism. SAME anatomy size across twelve poses; poses may crouch/jump but do not shrink head/body to fit. Camera direction remains requested view except natural full-body turning during roundhouse; recovery returns to requested view.
READ LEFT TO RIGHT, then next row:
0 WALK left-foot forward contact, right foot trailing, fists low guarded, no attack trail;
1 WALK left-foot support, right knee passing forward, distinct torso/arms counter-swing;
2 WALK right-foot forward contact, left foot trailing, fists low guarded;
3 WALK right-foot support, left knee passing forward, distinct counter-swing. Four frames form continuous alternating stride, real different leg drawings.
4 DODGE anticipation, lowered center, guard closed;
5 DODGE passing low evasive lateral step, body bent, both legs/arms complete, no planar rotation;
6 DODGE recovery back to low fighting guard, distinct crouched-to-upright pose;
7 GUARD stable raised gauntlets protecting face/torso, whole face visible where geometric;
8 PARRY deflecting contact, one armored forearm angled across torso, other fist protecting, tiny form-color spark;
9 HURT staggered torso recoil, both fists present, feet regaining balance, clean face no blood;
10 DEATH loss of balance, buckling to knee, lowered head, same armor/clothes;
11 DEATH final complete body fallen naturally on ground plane, limbs/face/hair/armor intact, subdued aura, no detached pieces. Draw body lying anatomically, NOT a flat image rotation. Ground itself transparent.
Walk aura subdued and attached to limbs; guard/dodge a little brighter; death aura dissipates.
Reserve breathing room around ALL limbs and energy. No neighboring figures touching. Candidate production sheet, no text.
